{"domain": "morningpeopleclothiers.com", "products": [{"id": 15427633053909, "title": "The Cashmere Sweater", "handle": "the-cashmere-sweater", "body_html": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Our golf layering vanity project. We're excited about this one because we believe cashmere is ideal for the golf course. It's naturally warm, wind-resistant, and lightweight, all while providing a luxurious feel. It won't constrict your swing, and won't look shiny in the sun. Ours is maximal on feel, minimal in design.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>If you think the pros look proper at The Open, this is how they do it. Elegant textures, mature colors, and nothing unnecessary. If you could only pick one, this is it, this is your new favorite golf sweater.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\u00a0</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Features a traditional fit, natural warmth, and elegant drape.</span><b></b></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>100% cashmere.</span><b></b></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Proudly designed in the USA, crafted in Cambodia.</span></p>", "published_at": "2026-10-11T19:41:18-05:00", "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:07:41-05:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T10:03:02-05:00", "vendor": "Morning People Clothiers", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 67735864115413, "title": "S / Camel", "option1": "S", "option2": "Camel", "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "109.00", "grams": 283, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 15427633053909, "created_at": "2026-10-11T19:18:31-05:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T10:03:02-05:00"}, {"id": 67735928799445, "title": "S / Navy", "option1": "S", "option2": "Navy", "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "109.00", "grams": 283, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 2, "product_id": 15427633053909, "created_at": "2026-10-11T19:27:04-05:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T10:03